data: {"id": "600b86d25d3d4387-thinking-parallel_evidence-853", "run_id": "600b86d25d3d4387", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "）。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788772995605, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "600b86d25d3d4387-thinking-parallel_evidence-854", "run_id": "600b86d25d3d4387", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_describe + kubectl_get_yaml)\n\n**Pod 当前状态**: Pending，未 Running。容器 `app` 的 `reason=ContainerCreating`，`restarts=0`。\n\n**关键 Events**:\n- `FailedMount` (x40 over 74m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n- `FailedMount` (x31 over 72m): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition`\n\n**Pod 配置**:\n- Volume `input` 类型: `ConfigMap`，引用名", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788772995650, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "600b86d25d3d4387-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "600b86d25d3d4387", "seq": 855, "ts_ms": 1788773003361, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.511, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/600b86d25d3d4387-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "9f6d4f1d49273e238f71e78babfadecf1e121a51fdcba4827b2fb4ccce332afc", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "2890838b71e31c8516944296c1473dc8a35e640a7c34780898151b094b0fef1b"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "600b86d25d3d4387-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "600b86d25d3d4387", "seq": 856, "ts_ms": 1788773003361, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "600b86d25d3d4387-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "600b86d25d3d4387", "seq": 857, "ts_ms": 1788773013804, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.443, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1913, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-73286e2fecdd`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found | 确认 Volume 绑定失败的直接错误原因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-1f2ce2d827ba`: 4m17s (x31 over 72m) Unable to attach or mount volumes... timed out waiting for the condition | 证实挂载阻塞为持续发生的严重故障，而非瞬时抖动 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-ad5509ef19af`: Pod Status: Pending; `fact-f4c8deed7334`: Container Waiting Reason: ContainerCreating | 确认容器卡在初始化阶段，无法进入运行态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-16f26d739072`: ContainersReady=False (ContainersNotReady: app) | 确认就绪探针条件长期不满足 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-361cf4a568b8`: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1 | 指标层面的客观状态印证：容器处于等待创建状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-924c30c2cafa`: `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 确认容器未发生过启动失败，属于启动阻塞 |\n\nK8s 事件（#1, #2）直接指出了具体的缺失资源标识符 `unavailable-config`。指标（#5）与事件状态相互印证，确认该挂载故障是持续的阻塞原因，而非一次性事件（#6 确认无重启）。日志和链路追踪（Logging/Tracing）因容器未启动未采集到数据，但 Kubernetes 维度的状态与错误信息已构成闭环证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod  Spec 请求 Volume 'input' 绑定 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (非 Optional) → \nKubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 因找不到 ConfigMap 报错 → \nPod 持续 Pending / ContainerCreating，无法调度进入 Running 状态 → \n工作负载长时间未就绪且无应用日志产生\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在集群中不存在，且该 Volume 配置为非可选（Optional=false）**。\n\n*   该缺失资源直接导致了 `MountVolume.SetUp failed` 错误（`fact-73286e2fecdd`）。\n*   由于挂载无法完成，Kubelet 反复重试并触发超时（`fact-1f2ce2d827ba`），致使容器永远卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（`fact-f4c8deed7334`, `fact-361cf4a568b8`）。\n*   现有 K8s 事件与状态证据充分，可直接发布。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-73286e2fecdd`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found | 确认 Volume 绑定失败的直接错误原因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `fact-1f2ce2d827ba`: 4m17s (x31 over 72m) Unable to attach or mount volumes... timed out waiting for the condition | 证实挂载阻塞为持续发生的严重故障，而非瞬时抖动 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-ad5509ef19af`: Pod Status: Pending; `fact-f4c8deed7334`: Container Waiting Reason: ContainerCreating | 确认容器卡在初始化阶段，无法进入运行态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-16f26d739072`: ContainersReady=False (ContainersNotReady: app) | 确认就绪探针条件长期不满足 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-361cf4a568b8`: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1 | 指标层面的客观状态印证：容器处于等待创建状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-924c30c2cafa`: `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 确认容器未发生过启动失败，属于启动阻塞 |\n\nK8s 事件（#1, #2）直接指出了具体的缺失资源标识符 `unavailable-config`。指标（#5）与事件状态相互印证，确认该挂载故障是持续的阻塞原因，而非一次性事件（#6 确认无重启）。日志和链路追踪（Logging/Tracing）因容器未启动未采集到数据，但 Kubernetes 维度的状态与错误信息已构成闭环证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod  Spec 请求 Volume 'input' 绑定 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (非 Optional) → \nKubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 因找不到 ConfigMap 报错 → \nPod 持续 Pending / ContainerCreating，无法调度进入 Running 状态 → \n工作负载长时间未就绪且无应用日志产生\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在集群中不存在，且该 Volume 配置为非可选（Optional=false）**。\n\n*   该缺失资源直接导致了 `MountVolume.SetUp failed` 错误（`fact-73286e2fecdd`）。\n*   由于挂载无法完成，Kubelet 反复重试并触发超时（`fact-1f2ce2d827ba`），致使容器永远卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（`fact-f4c8deed7334`, `fact-361cf4a568b8`）。\n*   现有 K8s 事件与状态证据充分，可直接发布。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

